+### Deprecated
+
+- The static method `mod_quiz\local\override_manager::get_effective_open_close_times()` is deprecated in favour of `mod_quiz\local\override_manager::get_effective_times()`. The deprecated method still returns only the `timeopen` and `timeclose` values.
+
+  For more information see [MDL-89711](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-89711)
+
 ### Changed
 
 - If your plugin implements its own quiz report (a subclass of `mod_quiz\local\reports\report_base`), you need to update it to keep the old group selector working, because `report_base::print_header_and_tabs()` no longer prints it, and to pick up the new navigation bar (report selector, group selector, user search and initials filter).
